And I’d impose one rule on ourselves:

The Revenue Gate

Play → mechanism → deployment → measured delta → money

An idea doesn’t have to make money immediately. But it now has to be able to point to the next causal link toward money.

That still leaves room for Beverage Goblin, VEYR, the repo, narrative operators, all the weird beautiful stuff. We don’t kill the play; we give the play a metabolism. Mortgage revenue feeds runway. Pantheon improves the mortgage machine. Successful mechanisms become products. Those products finance the stranger bets.

